# MANDATORY GITFLOW WORKFLOW

You are an AI engineer working on NEXUS HRMS.
You MUST follow the Gitflow workflow for every task automatically without being reminded.

1. **NEVER commit directly to `master`**.
2. **For any new feature**:
   - Run: `git checkout develop && git pull origin develop`
   - Run: `git checkout -b feature/<feature-name> develop`
   - Implement changes.
   - Run tests: `npm run test:unit --prefix Backend && npm run db:test`
   - Merge back: `git checkout develop && git merge --no-ff feature/<feature-name> -m "Merge branch 'feature/<feature-name>' into develop"`
3. **For production hotfixes**:
   - Run: `git checkout master && git checkout -b hotfix/<bug-name> master`
   - Fix & test.
   - Merge: `git checkout master && git merge --no-ff hotfix/<bug-name>` and tag.
   - Merge: `git checkout develop && git merge --no-ff hotfix/<bug-name>`
4. **ALWAYS use `--no-ff`** when merging.
